  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "NEW Luxury Property<br><br>A Lovely Day | Coastal Chic Seagrove Retreat with Gulf Views<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS<br><br>- Gulf & Eastern Lake Views<br>- Sleeps 20<br>- 6 BR | 5.5 BA<br>- HEATED Community Pool<br>- Game Room (Garage)<br>- 4 Bikes Included<br>- Two Beach Accesses Just a 1–2 Minute Walk<br>- Rare Coastal Dune Lake Access<br><br> Welcome to A Lovely Day<br><br>Skip the long beach treks — at A Lovely Day, you're just a 1–2 minute stroll to the sand with TWO beach accesses along a private walkway.<br><br>Welcome to this beautifully updated coastal-chic retreat in Seagrove Beach, perfectly positioned less than two minutes from the sand. With four stories of thoughtfully designed living space, this home comfortably sleeps up to 20 guests—ideal for large families and multi-generational getaways along 30A.<br><br>One of the home's most exceptional features is its prime location along the private beachside walkway, offering two public beach access points within a quick 1–2 minute stroll. No long hauls with beach gear—just easy, effortless access to the sugar-white sand.<br><br>You'll also enjoy expansive views of both the Gulf and Eastern Lake, plus a HEATED community pool just steps from your door. As an added perk, your stay includes four complimentary bikes for cruising to nearby shops, restaurants, and scenic 30A paths.<br><br> Unique Coastal Lake + Beach Experience<br><br>The nearby Eastern Lake beach access features one of 30A's rare and beautiful coastal dune lakes, where calm lake waters meet the Gulf. This special setting creates the perfect environment to:<br><br>- Leisurely float in gentle water<br>- Catch minnows or enjoy casual fishing<br>- Let little ones safely splash in the shallows<br>- Relax by the lake while still watching the ocean waves<br><br>It's an ideal alternative for guests who love the beach views but prefer calmer water than the surf.<br><br> First Floor<br><br>The ground level offers a private king bedroom suite with TV and ensuite bath—perfect for guests wanting extra privacy. Accessible via covered outdoor stairs or elevator, this peaceful retreat sits just steps from the main home.<br><br>The garage game room is a favorite hangout for all ages, featuring:<br><br>- TV<br>- Foosball<br>- Ping pong<br>- Large table for group games<br>- Multiple oversized cooling fans<br><br>Open the garage doors to create a breezy, comfortable play space with easy access for quick walks to the pool and back. Step outside to the patio with Gulf views and the private beachside walkway.<br><br> Second Floor<br><br>This level features one of two spacious living areas plus three comfortable bedrooms. The spacious, cozy sectional offers plenty of room for movie nights and family time. Guests will also enjoy a smart TV, DVD player with movies, and a curated library of books.<br><br>Step onto the balcony to enjoy beach and lake views and appreciate just how close you are to the coast.<br><br> Third Floor — The Heart of the Home<br><br>The main living, kitchen, and dining space offers Gulf glimpses and plenty of room for everyone to gather.<br><br>- Dining table for 12<br>- Bar seating for 5<br>- Fully equipped kitchen<br>- Crock-Pot, air fryer, griddle & blender included<br>- Convenient laundry room<br><br>Outside, in the designated grill area by the garage, fire up the grill and then take food in to dine al fresco at the table for six on the third-floor balcony while taking in beach and lake views, or unwind in the multiple outdoor lounge areas—perfect for sunrise coffee or sunset cocktails.<br><br> Fourth Floor — Kid-Favorite Retreat<br><br>A dream space for younger guests! The top floor sleeps 8 and includes a cozy reading nook and TV area—perfect for movie marathons or quiet downtime. Enjoy expansive, majestic Gulf views from the top floor — a true guest favorite.<br><br> Designed for Gathering & Relaxing<br><br>With hangout spaces on every floor and two large porches for wave-watching and sunset views across the Gulf, A Lovely Day was designed for connection, comfort, and coastal living at its best.<br><br> SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS:<br>1st Floor — <br>Bedroom 1: King bed, TV. Private bath with dual sinks.<br><br>2nd Floor — Bedroom 2: Queen bed, TV.<br> 2nd Floor— Bedroom 3: Queen bed, TV.<br><br>- Hall bath with tub/shower combo<br>- Two twin rollaway beds located in closets<br><br>2nd Floor — <br>Bedroom 4: King bed, TV, balcony access. Private bath with dual vanities.<br><br>3rd Floor — <br>Bedroom 5: King bed, TV. Large updated private bath with double showers and sinks.<br><br>4th Floor — <br>Bedroom 6:<br>- 3 twin beds<br>- 3 twin trundles<br>- Additional queen bed (not pictured)<br>- TV<br>- Half bath on 4th floor<br>- Shared full bath on 3rd floor<br><br> Beach Access<br><br>Enjoy two convenient options along the private beachside walkway:<br><br>- West: Ramsgate Beach Access<br>- East: Eastern Lake Beach Access (coastal dune lake + Gulf)<br><br>Distance: ~0.1 miles<br>Walk Time: 1–2 minutes<br> Dalton Place Perks<br>A stay in Dalton Place puts the emerald Gulf waters within easy reach via both Eastern Lake and Ramsgate accesses. You'll also enjoy the HEATED community pool located just across Eastern Lake Road at Camelot Lane. The community clubhouse can be rented for private parties or events. You are also walking distance to Greenway Station, Seagrove Beach's vibrant hub for shopping, dining, and relaxation. Additionally, it features convenient access to Point Washington State Forest and the scenic Timpoochee Trail—perfect for explorers and nature lovers.<br><br>From effortless beach mornings to sunset porch evenings, A Lovely Day delivers the perfect blend of location, comfort, and elevated coastal charm. Book your stay today<br><br> Additional Details:<br>- Parking for 4 cars (no garage parking)<br>- Sorry, no pets<br>- Blue light<br><br>Guest must be at least 25 years of age to book.<br>NO smoking allowed.<br>NO pets.<br>Check out time is 10 am<br>Check in time is 4 pm<br>Walton County FL has a noise ordinance. Quiet hours are from 10pm- 7am<br>You must obey the rules and regulations of the HOA and the laws local to our area.<br><br>Please Note - Seasonal Booking Requirements:<br>During Spring Break is a 5 Night Minimum<br>Summer this home only allows Saturday - Saturday 7 Day reservations.<br><br>Spring Break - 2/28/2026 - 4/18/2026<br>Summer Break- 5/23/2026 - 8/15/2026",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "New! Gulf & Lake Views, 6 BR, HEATED Pool & 2 minute walk to the beach!"
        }
      ],
