        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Amazing beach views and l location! 1 minute walk to beach and a short walk to restaurants, shops and walking/- biking trails. House was very spacious and the kids loved the game room ! We will be back.",
        "title": "5 Stars"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brandy S.",
        "date": "2025-06-11T20:49:10Z",
        "id": "68557998474db301a01b055d",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "The house was perfect to accommodate our entire family of 17. Me and my husband slept on the bottom level which we loved, it was like we had our own place. The bunk room was great for all the kiddos. The beach was just a few minutes walk away and not too crowded. The garage game room was great for the teenagers to play games in. It was very easy to communicate with the host through text messaging. We would love to stay there again in the future!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
