          {
            "date": "Jan 23, 2025",
            "id": "9ef2392e-325a-45d3-9e0f-7ed248e8892f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Dear Debbie,\n\nThank you for sharing your experience! We’re thrilled to hear that our property provided the perfect setting for your board’s productive retreat. It’s wonderful that you found the accommodations both collaborative and private, and that the refreshing beach walks added to your stay. We hope to welcome you back for another seamless experience in the future!\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This was the perfect place for the board to work un distracted with refreshing breaks of walks on the beach.Accommodations allowed each member to have their own space with great collaborative working space.",
